# CDK TypeScript ecosystem

Read `ecosystems/cdk-typescript/AGENTS.md` for full constraints.

## Key rules

- cdk-nag is mandatory on every stack (ADR-CDK-001)
- All security suppressions require a comment with justification
- Run `cd ecosystems/cdk-typescript && make verify` after changes
- Do not suppress cdk-nag rules without justification in the construct

## Stack

TypeScript, AWS CDK v2, jest, eslint, cdk-nag.
